      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "What I don't like about how this works now is that I'm accidentally clicking chairs, buttons and avatars when I don't mean to. Fist is my most-used gesture and it got remapped from middle finger to pointer finger. It's a bit of a hassle getting used to.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
