      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I noticed this on my Oculus as well. I assume the reason that the trigger is now what is used is to give Index the option for analog control on fist, and that is good. However, it really sucks to change everyone else's control scheme as well. Many people have spent the better part of 3 years with the current Oculus control scheme and are going to be very mixed up by the sudden needless change.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
